      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and communicative veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients praise the veterinarians and support staff for their warmth, professionalism, and detailed medical guidance. Many reviews emphasize that doctors answer every question patiently without rushing, providing honest recommendations and thoughtful follow-up calls after diagnostic procedures and vaccinations."
      },
      "mentions": 32
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient care for timid animals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners repeatedly commend the hospital team for their extraordinarily gentle approach with sensitive, rescue, and antisocial pets. Reviewers note that veterinarians take the time to let dogs and cats acclimate to exam rooms, ensuring that even animals who dislike vet visits feel safe and thoroughly cared for."
      },
      "mentions": 22
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "title": {
        "en": "Clean and modern community hospital"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers regularly mention the inviting, spotless environment and efficient organization at the Queen Street East facility. Pet parents appreciate the comfortable reception space and note that the hospital maintains high hygiene standards while fostering a neighborly and compassionate community atmosphere."
      },
      "mentions": 12
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How does Leslieville Animal Hospital support pets with veterinary anxiety?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Pet parents report that the staff use gentle handling, calm voices, and patient techniques to ensure nervous or antisocial pets feel comfortable."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What surgical and medical services does the hospital offer?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Services include routine spaying and neutering, soft tissue surgery, dental cleanings, cardiology consultations, and diagnostic lab testing."
      },
      "basis": "website"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can pet owners receive veterinary advice over the phone?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers mention speaking directly with clinic staff who provided helpful guidance and accommodated urgent appointment requests."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Where are patients referred for after-hours emergency care?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "After-hours emergencies are referred to Toronto Animal Health Partners and VCA Canada Toronto Veterinary Emergency Hospital."
      },
      "basis": "website"
    }
